  "brief_en": "Read run.gpx and map.json. Make a 20-second vertical story replaying the complete synthetic run in compressed time. Draw the route on local-map.svg, move a runner marker, and update elapsed time, cumulative distance and average pace from the GPX. Clearly distinguish real run elapsed time from video time. End with an accurate summary.",
